AFS SSO

DESCRIPTION
       Sign in with single sign-on and show who you are.

SYNOPSIS
       afs sso <operation> [parameters]

OPERATIONS
       get-caller-identity            Get me
       list-providers                 List sign in providers
       login                          Sign in with single sign-on (device authorization) and cache the session.
       logout                         Delete the cached single sign-on session of the profile.

To see help text for an operation, run: afs sso <operation> help
